<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/futb-crest.png">
    <title>Privacy Policy - FUTB Housing</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <script src="/js/theme.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-soft">
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-white border-bottom sticky-top shadow-sm">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand brand fw-bold" href="/" aria-label="FUTB Housing home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/futb-crest.png" alt="Federal University of Technology Babura crest">FUTB <span class="text-success">Housing</span></a>
            <div class="d-flex gap-3 align-items-center">
                <a class="nav-link text-dark" href="/properties"><i class="bi bi-buildings me-1"></i>Browse homes</a>
                <a class="nav-link text-dark" href="/terms">Terms</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>
    <main class="container legal-page py-5">
        <header class="mb-4">
            <span class="eyebrow text-uppercase">FUTB Housing</span>
            <h1 class="fw-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Last updated: October 27, 2026</p>
        </header>
        <article class="legal-document">
            <section>
                <h2>Information we collect</h2>
                <p>When you use FUTB Housing, we may store the name, email address, phone number, and account role you provide. Users who set up payouts provide a bank name and account number for verification. Paystack processes the full bank details; FUTB Housing stores Paystack recipient or subaccount codes, account holder name, bank name, and last four account digits, not the full account number. Property videos are hosted by Cloudinary; FUTB Housing stores their URLs, along with property listings, ratings, comments, booking messages and status, and payment references needed to operate the service.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>How information is used</h2>
                <p>We use this information to create and secure accounts, display listings, connect students and landlords, manage bookings, verify payment status, and maintain the service. Account and listing information may be visible to other users where needed for those features.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Payments, cookies, and storage</h2>
                <p>Payments are completed through Paystack's hosted checkout. FUTB Housing does not store payment card details. Paystack processes and stores landlord payout account details for split settlement. The app stores payment references, amounts, outcomes, and masked payout details to keep booking and payout records accurate.</p>
                <p>The app uses a session cookie to keep you signed in and local browser storage to remember your display-theme preference. Data is stored by the service's configured database and hosting providers.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Sharing and retention</h2>
                <p>We share information with the relevant student or landlord when needed to provide listing and booking features, and with service providers that support hosting, database storage, or payment processing. We do not use the app to collect card details.</p>
                <p>We retain account, listing, and booking information for as long as needed to operate the service, meet operational requirements, and maintain transaction records. Do not include sensitive personal information in listing descriptions or booking messages.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2>Your choices and questions</h2>
                <p>You can review or update available account details from your profile page. For privacy questions or requests concerning your information, contact the FUTB Housing administrator through the official channel provided by the service operator.</p>
            </section>
        </article>
    </main>
    <%- include('partials/legal-footer') %>
</body>
</html>